# Frozen third-party snapshots. The committed file IS the pin, and every one of
# them carries a documented patch of ours — reformatting would bury the patch in
# thousands of lines of noise and make the next update impossible to review.
thirdparty/*
# Generated from raylib_multiplatform.toml on every configure. Formatting it
# would be undone by the next `cmake --preset debug`.
include/raylib_multiplatform/generated/*
